Description: Provides the header-only 'OpenGL Mathematics' (GLM) 'C++'
    library for numerical computations in graphics and geometry
    <https://github.com/g-truc/glm>. Includes vector and matrix types,
    coordinate transformations, quaternions, and geometric functions
    following the conventions of the 'OpenGL Shading Language'.
